OL,3,ASeven killed and 23 missing after boat
OL,4,Acapsizes off northern Cyprus, says
OL,5,ATurkish Cypriot PM
OL,6,
OL,7,FSeven people have died after a
OL,8,Fpassenger boat capsized near northern
OL,9,FCyprus, the Turkish Cypriot PM says
OL,11,FSearch and rescue operations are under
OL,12,Fway to find 23 people missing, says
OL,13,FUnal Ustel, the prime minister of the
OL,14,Fself-declared territory
OL,16,FHe says 267 people were on board the
OL,17,Fvessel when it capsized, and 237 have
OL,18,Fbeen rescued
